(1353,	18,	'_list_0_title',	'field_5ccc6ecb7ffc7'),
(1354,	18,	'list_0_text',	'BRiZ e-scooter makes a short commute across densely populated urban areas really easy, eco-friendly and extremely enjoyable. Did we mention its also very affordable? The scooters only cost $1 to start and then 25 cents per minute. Are you ready to take a ride?'),
