(2501,	214,	'_block_1_questions_2_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(2502,	214,	'block_1_questions_3_question',	'Ride'),
(2503,	214,	'_block_1_questions_3_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(2504,	214,	'block_1_questions_3_answer',	'Keep both feet on the E-Scooter while riding. Ride in bike lanes where available,\r\ndo not ride on sidewalks. You can push the brake button with your left thumb to\r\nslow down if needed.'),
(2505,	214,	'_block_1_questions_3_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(2506,	214,	'block_1_questions_4_question',	'Parking'),
(2507,	214,	'_block_1_questions_4_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(2508,	214,	'block_1_questions_4_answer',	'To keep yourself and others safe, please ensure that you park in designated areas. Scooter\r\nparking areas are available in some cities; otherwise, please check the in-app map for\r\nplaces to park. This makes it easier for other riders to find the scooter later. Be considerate\r\nof others and don’t park too far away from accessible pedestrian walkways. Additionally,\r\nbe careful not to park in no-parking zones, including wheelchair ramps, blocking streets or\r\nsidewalks, hospital entrances, fire stations, gated communities, and locations with no phone\r\nservice, among others.'),
(2509,	214,	'_block_1_questions_4_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(2510,	214,	'block_1_questions_5_question',	'Unlocking More Than One Vehicle'),
(2511,	214,	'_block_1_questions_5_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(2512,	214,	'block_1_questions_5_answer',	'Only one vehicle per account can be unlocked at a time, and the rider whose account is\r\nused to unlock the vehicle must be the only person who rides it. Any damage caused by\r\nthird-party riders will be attributed to the account-holder.'),
(2513,	214,	'_block_1_questions_5_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(2514,	214,	'block_1_questions_6_question',	'Pausing your Ride'),
(2515,	214,	'_block_1_questions_6_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(2516,	214,	'block_1_questions_6_answer',	'You can temporarily stop your ride, keeping your vehicle reserved until you want to\r\nresume your trip. The per-minute charge will continue to accumulate while the e-\r\nscooter is paused.\r\nTapping “End Ride” will stop the per-minute charges, and will make the vehicle available\r\nto other users. If you do not end the ride, the charges will continue, so make sure you end it\r\nonce you are done!'),
(2517,	214,	'_block_1_questions_6_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(2518,	214,	'block_1_questions_7_question',	'Stop for more than 10 minutes'),
(2519,	214,	'_block_1_questions_7_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(2520,	214,	'block_1_questions_7_answer',	'During your ride, if the E-Scooter is not moving for more than 10 minutes, the\r\nmotor will turn off automatically. Please click the “Continue to Ride” button in the\r\napp to unlock and continue your rides.'),
(2521,	214,	'_block_1_questions_7_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(2522,	214,	'block_1_questions_8_question',	'End Ride'),
(2523,	214,	'_block_1_questions_8_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(2524,	214,	'block_1_questions_8_answer',	'End your ride by clicking “Lock” in the app. Confirm that you have parked within the\r\noperating area. If you do not park within the operating area, you will be fined.\r\nTapping “End Ride” will stop the per-minute charges, and will make the vehicle available\r\nto other users. If you do not end the ride, the charges will continue, so make sure you end it\r\nonce you are done!'),
(2525,	214,	'_block_1_questions_8_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(2526,	214,	'block_1_questions_9_question',	'Operating area'),
(2527,	214,	'_block_1_questions_9_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(2528,	214,	'block_1_questions_9_answer',	'Please check the map to see the operating area in your city.\r\n\r\nYou can start and end your ride wherever you want within the operating area in the\r\nsame region displayed without any surcharges. During your ride, you can leave the\r\noperating area. Just make sure you finish your ride in the operating area.\r\nPlease make sure you park your E-Scooter properly. If you park your E-Scooter\r\noutside the operating area, retrieval service charges may incur for you.'),
(2529,	214,	'_block_1_questions_9_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(2530,	214,	'block_1_questions_10_question',	'Basic Rules for riding an e-\r\nscooter'),
(2531,	214,	'_block_1_questions_10_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(2532,	214,	'block_1_questions_10_answer',	'- Riding on the sidewalk: not allowed.\r\n- Streets without differentiated sidewalk: Only allowed when the use of vehicles is\r\nauthorized and always at a speed of 10 or 20 km/h\r\n- Bike lane placed on the sidewalk: - Riding will be allowed as long as it is done in the\r\ndirection indicated on the lane, at a speed of 10 or 20 km/h and following the traffic\r\nsignals.\r\n- 30 km/h zone: - Riding will be allowed when the vehicles’ speed is higher than 20 km/h.\r\n- Road: - Only if the street or the regional road network is equipped with cycling\r\n\r\ninfrastructure (bike lane).\r\n- Parks: - Riding will only be allowed at a speed limit of 10 km/h. Pedestrians’ priority,\r\nnatural heritage, and urban furniture shall be respected.\r\n- Traffic signals, bike lanes and routes shall be followed, if available.\r\n- Riding on parterres, areas with any kind of vegetation, or any area that indicates a\r\nprohibition is not allowed.'),
(2533,	214,	'_block_1_questions_10_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(2534,	214,	'block_1_questions',	'11'),
(2535,	214,	'_block_1_questions',	'field_5caf3b2cbbe3f'),
(2536,	214,	'block_2_h2',	'Payments &amp; Pricing'),
(2537,	214,	'_block_2_h2',	'field_5caf3b5bbbe42'),
(2538,	214,	'block_2_questions_0_question',	'How much is it to ride?'),
(2539,	214,	'_block_2_questions_0_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(2540,	214,	'block_2_questions_0_answer',	'Unlocking the vehicle incurs a fixed charge, followed by a per-minute charge for the\r\nduration of your trip. Please check your app to find up-to-date pricing information (visible\r\nwhen you select a vehicle from the map) as different cities may have different rates and\r\npromotions.'),
(2541,	214,	'_block_2_questions_0_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(2542,	214,	'block_2_questions_1_question',	'Payment methods'),
(2543,	214,	'_block_2_questions_1_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(2544,	214,	'block_2_questions_1_answer',	'Currently, you can pay by credit card (Visa, MasterCard), PayPal, Apple Pay and\r\nGoogle Pay. We currently support Apple Pay and Google Pay in Switzerland. More\r\ncountries to come in the future.\r\nRegardless of which payment method you use, we will charge $1 to verify the\r\naccount. Of course, this $1 will be refunded immediately. We will only charge any\r\nfurther amounts after completing a ride.'),
(2545,	214,	'_block_2_questions_1_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(2546,	214,	'block_2_questions_2_question',	'Adding a Payment Method'),
(2547,	214,	'_block_2_questions_2_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(2548,	214,	'block_2_questions_2_answer',	'Adding a payment method to your account makes it easy to pay for your rides. You can\r\nchoose to either pay per ride, in which case your card will be charged after each ride, or\r\ndeposit credit into a wallet, which will be automatically deducted as needed.'),
(2549,	214,	'_block_2_questions_2_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(2550,	214,	'block_2_questions_3_question',	'Pre-Authorization'),
(2551,	214,	'_block_2_questions_3_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(2552,	214,	'block_2_questions_3_answer',	'The app may charge a small amount to your card at the beginning of your ride as a pre-\r\nauthorization. If you do not have sufficient funds in your wallet, the app will automatically\r\nuse your card to pay for the ride. This pre-authorization charge will be refunded after a\r\nsuccessful payment.'),
(2553,	214,	'_block_2_questions_3_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(2554,	214,	'block_2_questions_4_question',	'What if I’m charged incorrectly?'),
(2555,	214,	'_block_2_questions_4_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(2556,	214,	'block_2_questions_4_answer',	'<i>Our payment service provider may charge a small amount to your card as a security and\r\n\r\nauthorization measure, but this will be refunded after each ride.</i><br>\r\nIf your credit card or bank account is showing an unknown charge, please get in touch with\r\nyour bank and initiate a support request with us. We will then look into your claim and\r\nadjust the charge accordingly.'),
(2557,	214,	'_block_2_questions_4_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(2558,	214,	'block_2_questions',	'5'),
(2559,	214,	'_block_2_questions',	'field_5caf3b2cbbe3f'),
(2560,	20,	'block_3_h2',	'Safety'),
(2561,	20,	'_block_3_h2',	'field_5caf3b5bbbe42'),
(2562,	20,	'block_3_questions_0_question',	'Checking your vehicle for safety'),
(2563,	20,	'_block_3_questions_0_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(2564,	20,	'block_3_questions_0_answer',	'Before unlocking your e-scooter, check it over for damage. If there are wires coming out or\r\nother obvious damage, let us know through the app and find a different vehicle to use.'),
(2565,	20,	'_block_3_questions_0_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(2566,	20,	'block_3_questions_1_question',	'Is there an age limit?'),
(2567,	20,	'_block_3_questions_1_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(2568,	20,	'block_3_questions_1_answer',	'Every region, country and city will have different age restrictions, but we advise that only\r\n\r\npeople 21 years or older drive the vehicles.'),
(2569,	20,	'_block_3_questions_1_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(2570,	20,	'block_3_questions_2_question',	'Is a driver’s license necessary?'),
(2571,	20,	'_block_3_questions_2_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(2572,	20,	'block_3_questions_2_answer',	'No, a driver’s license is not legally required for e-scooter operation.'),
(2573,	20,	'_block_3_questions_2_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(2574,	20,	'block_3_questions_3_question',	'Is a helmet necessary?'),
(2575,	20,	'_block_3_questions_3_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(2576,	20,	'block_3_questions_3_answer',	'For your safety, you should always wear a helmet while riding our scooters.'),
(2577,	20,	'_block_3_questions_3_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(2578,	20,	'block_3_questions_4_question',	'Helmet Laws'),
(2579,	20,	'_block_3_questions_4_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(2580,	20,	'block_3_questions_4_answer',	'Every region, country, and city has its own laws about helmets. Using safety equipment\r\nlike helmets does not completely protect you from injury, but we suggest you always wear\r\nthem in order to minimize risk. Some regions legally require riders to wear helmets, so\r\ncheck local regulations and use safety gear accordingly. If you are injured while riding\r\nwithout a helmet, we do not bear responsibility for your choice to take this risk.'),
(2581,	20,	'_block_3_questions_4_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(2582,	20,	'block_3_questions_5_question',	'Safe driving'),
(2583,	20,	'_block_3_questions_5_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(2584,	20,	'block_3_questions_5_answer',	'Driving as carefully and safely as possible should be your top priority while on one of our\r\nscooters, meaning you should obey all traffic laws and use your best judgment when riding.'),
(2585,	20,	'_block_3_questions_5_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(2586,	20,	'block_3_questions_6_question',	'What if I have an accident?'),
(2587,	20,	'_block_3_questions_6_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(2588,	20,	'block_3_questions_6_answer',	'If there is an accident and need medical help, contact your local emergency services for\r\n\r\nassistance.\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>If you are injured, please stay at the location where the accident took place.</li>\r\n<li> If you are not injured, find a safe area nearby to move to.</li>\r\n</ul>'),
(2589,	20,	'_block_3_questions_6_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(2590,	20,	'block_3_questions',	'7'),
(2591,	20,	'_block_3_questions',	'field_5caf3b2cbbe3f'),
(2592,	215,	'h1',	'So you have questions about scooters?'),
(2593,	215,	'_h1',	'field_5caf3ae91bc56'),
(2594,	215,	'text',	'You\'ve got questions. Brize has answers. From \"How do I pay for a Brize\" to \"How do I locate a Brize near me\", find out all you need to know about our smart mobility service here.'),
(2595,	215,	'_text',	'field_5caf3aee1bc57'),
(2596,	215,	'block_0_h2',	'Account'),
(2597,	215,	'_block_0_h2',	'field_5caf3b5bbbe42'),
(2598,	215,	'block_0_questions_0_question',	'Create an account'),
(2599,	215,	'_block_0_questions_0_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(2600,	215,	'block_0_questions_0_answer',	'You can use your phone number or Facebook account to sign up. If you use a phone\r\nnumber, we will send you a verification code in a text message, which you can input in\r\norder to finish registering. For Facebook or email sign-ups, we will send a confirmation\r\nlink to your email address which you can click to verify your email.'),
(2601,	215,	'_block_0_questions_0_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(2602,	215,	'block_0_questions',	'8'),
(2603,	215,	'_block_0_questions',	'field_5caf3b2cbbe3f'),
(2604,	215,	'block',	'4'),
(2605,	215,	'_block',	'field_5caf3af31bc58'),
(2606,	215,	'button_1_title',	'Contact support'),
(2607,	215,	'_button_1_title',	'field_5caf3df6345b3'),
(2608,	215,	'button_1_url',	''),
(2609,	215,	'_button_1_url',	'field_5caf3dfd345b4'),
(2610,	215,	'button_2_title',	'Visit help center'),
(2611,	215,	'_button_2_title',	'field_5caf3e03345b5'),
(2612,	215,	'button_2_url',	''),
(2613,	215,	'_button_2_url',	'field_5caf3e09345b6'),
(2614,	215,	'phone',	'+7 495 000 04 95'),
(2615,	215,	'_phone',	'field_5caf3e0f345b7'),
(2616,	215,	'block_0_questions_1_question',	'What payment methods can I use?'),
(2617,	215,	'_block_0_questions_1_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(2618,	215,	'block_0_questions_1_answer',	'We accept credit cards (Visa, MasterCard and American Express), PayPal and Apple Pay.\r\nIn the future, we will support different methods of payment in more countries. A 1€\r\nverification charge applies regardless of payment method.'),
(2619,	215,	'_block_0_questions_1_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(2620,	215,	'block_0_questions_2_question',	'Forgot Password'),
(2621,	215,	'_block_0_questions_2_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(2622,	215,	'block_0_questions_2_answer',	'If you need to reset your password, go to the login page and click “forgot password.” If you\r\nsigned up with your email address, you will get a reset link in your inbox. If you used a\r\nphone number we will send a text (SMS) with a reset link to your phone.'),
(2623,	215,	'_block_0_questions_2_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(2624,	215,	'block_0_questions_3_question',	'Is there a registration fee for the\r\napp?'),
(2625,	215,	'_block_0_questions_3_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(2626,	215,	'block_0_questions_3_answer',	'No, there are no registration fees'),
(2627,	215,	'_block_0_questions_3_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(2628,	215,	'block_0_questions_4_question',	'What can I do if I don’t get the\r\nSMS?'),
(2629,	215,	'_block_0_questions_4_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(2630,	215,	'block_0_questions_4_answer',	'If you still have not gotten the verification SMS 5 minutes after signing up, please hit the\r\n“resend” button or get in touch with customer service.'),
(2631,	215,	'_block_0_questions_4_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(2632,	215,	'block_0_questions_5_question',	'I am not getting the verification\r\nmessages'),
(2633,	215,	'_block_0_questions_5_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(2634,	215,	'block_0_questions_5_answer',	'If you register with your phone number it must be a number that can receive text messages.\r\nCheck to make sure that you have reception and don’t have an SMS blocker turned on. If\r\nyou don’t get the code in one minute or less, request the code again.'),
(2635,	215,	'_block_0_questions_5_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(2636,	215,	'block_0_questions_6_question',	'Will the app work on my phone?'),
(2637,	215,	'_block_0_questions_6_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(2638,	215,	'block_0_questions_6_answer',	'Our app is currently available for iOS9+ (iPhone 5S and newer models) and Android 4.1+.\r\nTurn on your GPS to find nearby E-Scooters on your map and grant the app location\r\npermissions. You must have both GPS and Bluetooth enabled in order to lock and unlock\r\ne-scooters.'),
(2639,	215,	'_block_0_questions_6_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(2640,	215,	'block_0_questions_7_question',	'Closing your account'),
(2641,	215,	'_block_0_questions_7_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(2642,	215,	'block_0_questions_7_answer',	'If you want to terminate your account, just contact our customer support team and they will take care of it for you.'),
(2643,	215,	'_block_0_questions_7_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(2644,	215,	'block_1_h2',	'Using Briz'),
(2645,	215,	'_block_1_h2',	'field_5caf3b5bbbe42'),
(2646,	215,	'block_1_questions_0_question',	'How can I find e-scooters?'),
(2647,	215,	'_block_1_questions_0_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(2648,	215,	'block_1_questions_0_answer',	'Launch the app and check for available e-scooters on the map. Once you select a vehicle\r\nthe map will give you directions to its location. Alternatively, you can just pick any vehicle\r\nyou see on the street and scan its QR code to unlock it.'),
(2649,	215,	'_block_1_questions_0_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(2650,	215,	'block_1_questions_1_question',	'Unlocking'),
(2651,	215,	'_block_1_questions_1_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(2652,	215,	'block_1_questions_1_answer',	'Once you find an e-scooter on the map you can unlock it by either scanning the QR\r\ncode or typing in the plate number. Tapping the flashlight icon will turn on the flashlight if\r\nthe QR code scanner is having trouble reading the code in low light.'),
(2653,	215,	'_block_1_questions_1_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(2654,	215,	'block_1_questions_2_question',	'Adjusting and Starting'),
(2655,	215,	'_block_1_questions_2_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(2656,	215,	'block_1_questions_2_answer',	'First, kick off and build up some speed. When you’re moving under your own power you\r\ncan accelerate by depressing the throttle near your right thumb. Get comfortable at low\r\nspeeds first and squeeze the brake to slow down when necessary.'),
(2657,	215,	'_block_1_questions_2_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(2658,	215,	'block_1_questions_3_question',	'Ride'),
(2659,	215,	'_block_1_questions_3_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(2660,	215,	'block_1_questions_3_answer',	'Keep both feet on the E-Scooter while riding. Ride in bike lanes where available,\r\ndo not ride on sidewalks. You can push the brake button with your left thumb to\r\nslow down if needed.'),
(2661,	215,	'_block_1_questions_3_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(2662,	215,	'block_1_questions_4_question',	'Parking'),
(2663,	215,	'_block_1_questions_4_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(2664,	215,	'block_1_questions_4_answer',	'To keep yourself and others safe, please ensure that you park in designated areas. Scooter\r\nparking areas are available in some cities; otherwise, please check the in-app map for\r\nplaces to park. This makes it easier for other riders to find the scooter later. Be considerate\r\nof others and don’t park too far away from accessible pedestrian walkways. Additionally,\r\nbe careful not to park in no-parking zones, including wheelchair ramps, blocking streets or\r\nsidewalks, hospital entrances, fire stations, gated communities, and locations with no phone\r\nservice, among others.'),
(2665,	215,	'_block_1_questions_4_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(2666,	215,	'block_1_questions_5_question',	'Unlocking More Than One Vehicle'),
(2667,	215,	'_block_1_questions_5_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(2668,	215,	'block_1_questions_5_answer',	'Only one vehicle per account can be unlocked at a time, and the rider whose account is\r\nused to unlock the vehicle must be the only person who rides it. Any damage caused by\r\nthird-party riders will be attributed to the account-holder.'),
(2669,	215,	'_block_1_questions_5_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
