(5177,	229,	'block_2_text',	'This is a smart, decentralized mobility<br> platform. We distribute shared electric<br> \r\n                    scooters that can be unlocked with a<br> \r\n                    smartphone. Users don’t need a key, cash,<br> \r\n                    physical IDs, or a deposit. After a few quick<br> \r\n                    steps in the app, anyone can hop on and ride.'),
