(6282,	239,	'phone',	'Email us: <a href=\"mailto:hello@briz.app\">hello@briz.app</a>'),
(6283,	239,	'_phone',	'field_5caf3e0f345b7'),
(6284,	239,	'block_0_questions_1_question',	'What payment methods can I use?'),
(6285,	239,	'_block_0_questions_1_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6286,	239,	'block_0_questions_1_answer',	'We accept credit cards (Visa, MasterCard and American Express), PayPal and Apple Pay.\r\nIn the future, we will support different methods of payment in more countries. A 1€\r\nverification charge applies regardless of payment method.'),
(6287,	239,	'_block_0_questions_1_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6288,	239,	'block_0_questions_2_question',	'Forgot Password'),
(6289,	239,	'_block_0_questions_2_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6290,	239,	'block_0_questions_2_answer',	'If you need to reset your password, go to the login page and click “forgot password.” If you\r\nsigned up with your email address, you will get a reset link in your inbox. If you used a\r\nphone number we will send a text (SMS) with a reset link to your phone.'),
(6291,	239,	'_block_0_questions_2_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6292,	239,	'block_0_questions_3_question',	'Is there a registration fee for the\r\napp?'),
(6293,	239,	'_block_0_questions_3_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6294,	239,	'block_0_questions_3_answer',	'No, there are no registration fees'),
(6295,	239,	'_block_0_questions_3_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6296,	239,	'block_0_questions_4_question',	'What can I do if I don’t get the\r\nSMS?'),
(6297,	239,	'_block_0_questions_4_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6298,	239,	'block_0_questions_4_answer',	'If you still have not gotten the verification SMS 5 minutes after signing up, please hit the\r\n“resend” button or get in touch with customer service.'),
(6299,	239,	'_block_0_questions_4_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6300,	239,	'block_0_questions_5_question',	'I am not getting the verification\r\nmessages'),
(6301,	239,	'_block_0_questions_5_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6302,	239,	'block_0_questions_5_answer',	'If you register with your phone number it must be a number that can receive text messages.\r\nCheck to make sure that you have reception and don’t have an SMS blocker turned on. If\r\nyou don’t get the code in one minute or less, request the code again.'),
(6303,	239,	'_block_0_questions_5_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6304,	239,	'block_0_questions_6_question',	'Will the app work on my phone?'),
(6305,	239,	'_block_0_questions_6_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6306,	239,	'block_0_questions_6_answer',	'Our app is currently available for iOS9+ (iPhone 5S and newer models) and Android 4.1+.\r\nTurn on your GPS to find nearby E-Scooters on your map and grant the app location\r\npermissions. You must have both GPS and Bluetooth enabled in order to lock and unlock\r\ne-scooters.'),
(6307,	239,	'_block_0_questions_6_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6308,	239,	'block_0_questions_7_question',	'Closing your account'),
(6309,	239,	'_block_0_questions_7_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6310,	239,	'block_0_questions_7_answer',	'If you want to terminate your account, just contact our customer support team and they will take care of it for you.'),
(6311,	239,	'_block_0_questions_7_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6312,	239,	'block_1_h2',	'Using Briz'),
(6313,	239,	'_block_1_h2',	'field_5caf3b5bbbe42'),
(6314,	239,	'block_1_questions_0_question',	'How can I find e-scooters?'),
(6315,	239,	'_block_1_questions_0_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6316,	239,	'block_1_questions_0_answer',	'Launch the app and check for available e-scooters on the map. Once you select a vehicle\r\nthe map will give you directions to its location. Alternatively, you can just pick any vehicle\r\nyou see on the street and scan its QR code to unlock it.'),
(6317,	239,	'_block_1_questions_0_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6318,	239,	'block_1_questions_1_question',	'Unlocking'),
(6319,	239,	'_block_1_questions_1_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6320,	239,	'block_1_questions_1_answer',	'Once you find an e-scooter on the map you can unlock it by either <b>scanning the QR\r\ncode</b> or typing in the plate number. Tapping the flashlight icon will turn on the flashlight if\r\nthe QR code scanner is having trouble reading the code in low light.'),
(6321,	239,	'_block_1_questions_1_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6322,	239,	'block_1_questions_2_question',	'Adjusting and Starting'),
(6323,	239,	'_block_1_questions_2_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6324,	239,	'block_1_questions_2_answer',	'First, kick off and build up some speed. When you’re moving under your own power you\r\ncan accelerate by depressing the throttle near your right thumb. Get comfortable at low\r\nspeeds first and squeeze the brake to slow down when necessary.'),
(6325,	239,	'_block_1_questions_2_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6326,	239,	'block_1_questions_3_question',	'Ride'),
(6327,	239,	'_block_1_questions_3_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6328,	239,	'block_1_questions_3_answer',	'Keep both feet on the E-Scooter while riding. Ride in bike lanes where available,\r\ndo not ride on sidewalks. You can push the brake button with your left thumb to\r\nslow down if needed.'),
(6329,	239,	'_block_1_questions_3_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6330,	239,	'block_1_questions_4_question',	'Parking'),
(6331,	239,	'_block_1_questions_4_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6332,	239,	'block_1_questions_4_answer',	'To keep yourself and others safe, please ensure that you park in designated areas. Scooter\r\nparking areas are available in some cities; otherwise, please check the in-app map for\r\nplaces to park. This makes it easier for other riders to find the scooter later. Be considerate\r\nof others and don’t park too far away from accessible pedestrian walkways. Additionally,\r\nbe careful not to park in no-parking zones, including wheelchair ramps, blocking streets or\r\nsidewalks, hospital entrances, fire stations, gated communities, and locations with no phone\r\nservice, among others.'),
(6333,	239,	'_block_1_questions_4_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6334,	239,	'block_1_questions_5_question',	'Unlocking More Than One Vehicle'),
(6335,	239,	'_block_1_questions_5_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6336,	239,	'block_1_questions_5_answer',	'Only one vehicle per account can be unlocked at a time, and the rider whose account is\r\nused to unlock the vehicle must be the only person who rides it. Any damage caused by\r\nthird-party riders will be attributed to the account-holder.'),
(6337,	239,	'_block_1_questions_5_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6338,	239,	'block_1_questions_6_question',	'Pausing your Ride'),
(6339,	239,	'_block_1_questions_6_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6340,	239,	'block_1_questions_6_answer',	'You can temporarily stop your ride, keeping your vehicle reserved until you want to\r\nresume your trip. <b>The per-minute charge will continue to accumulate while the e-\r\nscooter is paused.</b><br>\r\nTapping “<b>End Ride</b>” will stop the per-minute charges, and will make the vehicle available\r\nto other users. If you do not end the ride, the charges will continue, so make sure you end it\r\nonce you are done!'),
(6341,	239,	'_block_1_questions_6_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6342,	239,	'block_1_questions_7_question',	'Stop for more than 10 minutes'),
(6343,	239,	'_block_1_questions_7_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6344,	239,	'block_1_questions_7_answer',	'During your ride, if the E-Scooter is not moving for more than 10 minutes, the\r\nmotor will turn off automatically. Please click the “Continue to Ride” button in the\r\napp to unlock and continue your rides.'),
(6345,	239,	'_block_1_questions_7_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6346,	239,	'block_1_questions_8_question',	'End Ride'),
(6347,	239,	'_block_1_questions_8_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6348,	239,	'block_1_questions_8_answer',	'End your ride by clicking “Lock” in the app. Confirm that you have parked within the\r\noperating area. If you do not park within the operating area, you will be fined.<br>\r\nTapping “<b>End Ride</b>” will stop the per-minute charges, and will make the vehicle available\r\nto other users. If you do not end the ride, the charges will continue, so make sure you end it\r\nonce you are done!'),
(6349,	239,	'_block_1_questions_8_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6350,	239,	'block_1_questions_9_question',	'Operating area'),
(6351,	239,	'_block_1_questions_9_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6352,	239,	'block_1_questions_9_answer',	'Please check the map to see the operating area in your city.\r\n\r\nYou can start and end your ride wherever you want within the operating area in the\r\nsame region displayed without any surcharges. During your ride, you can leave the\r\noperating area. Just make sure you finish your ride in the operating area.\r\nPlease make sure you park your E-Scooter properly. If you park your E-Scooter\r\noutside the operating area, retrieval service charges may incur for you.'),
(6353,	239,	'_block_1_questions_9_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6354,	239,	'block_1_questions_10_question',	'Operating\r\nhours'),
(6355,	239,	'_block_1_questions_10_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6356,	239,	'block_1_questions_10_answer',	'BRiZ scooters will be available every day from 4 a.m. until 9 p.m. Because scooters need to be recharged on a nightly basis and ours are designed to not have swappable batteries, our operations team and chargers team will be responsible for removing dead-battery scooters from the streets and redeploying them the following morning.'),
(6357,	239,	'_block_1_questions_10_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6358,	239,	'block_1_questions',	'12'),
(6359,	239,	'_block_1_questions',	'field_5caf3b2cbbe3f'),
(6360,	239,	'block_2_h2',	'Payments & Pricing'),
(6361,	239,	'_block_2_h2',	'field_5caf3b5bbbe42'),
(6362,	239,	'block_2_questions_0_question',	'How much does it cost to ride BRiZ?'),
(6363,	239,	'_block_2_questions_0_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6364,	239,	'block_2_questions_0_answer',	'The basic fee for each e-scooter rental is $1 to unlock an\r\ne-scooter, plus 25 cents per minute of riding.<br>\r\nAdditional fee for returning an e-scooter outside an\r\n operating area may be charged.<br>\r\n Unlocking the vehicle incurs a fixed charge, followed by\r\n a per-minute charge for the duration of your trip.<br>\r\n Please check your app to find up-to-date pricing\r\n information (visible when you select a scooter from the\r\n map) as different cities and regions may have different\r\n rates and promotions.'),
(6365,	239,	'_block_2_questions_0_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6366,	239,	'block_2_questions_1_question',	'Payment methods'),
(6367,	239,	'_block_2_questions_1_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6368,	239,	'block_2_questions_1_answer',	'Currently, you can pay by credit card (Visa, MasterCard), PayPal, Apple Pay and\r\nGoogle Pay. We currently support Apple Pay and Google Pay in Switzerland. More\r\ncountries to come in the future.\r\nRegardless of which payment method you use, we will charge $1 to verify the\r\naccount. Of course, this $1 will be refunded immediately. We will only charge any\r\nfurther amounts after completing a ride.'),
(6369,	239,	'_block_2_questions_1_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6370,	239,	'block_2_questions_2_question',	'Adding a Payment Method'),
(6371,	239,	'_block_2_questions_2_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6372,	239,	'block_2_questions_2_answer',	'Adding a payment method to your account makes it easy to pay for your rides. You can\r\nchoose to either pay per ride, in which case your card will be charged after each ride, or\r\ndeposit credit into a wallet, which will be automatically deducted as needed.'),
(6373,	239,	'_block_2_questions_2_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6374,	239,	'block_2_questions_3_question',	'Pre-Authorization'),
(6375,	239,	'_block_2_questions_3_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6376,	239,	'block_2_questions_3_answer',	'The app may charge a small amount to your card at the beginning of your ride as a pre-\r\nauthorization. If you do not have sufficient funds in your wallet, the app will automatically\r\nuse your card to pay for the ride. This pre-authorization charge will be refunded after a\r\nsuccessful payment.'),
(6377,	239,	'_block_2_questions_3_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6378,	239,	'block_2_questions_4_question',	'What if I’m charged incorrectly?'),
(6379,	239,	'_block_2_questions_4_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6380,	239,	'block_2_questions_4_answer',	'<i>Our payment service provider may charge a small amount to your card as a security and\r\n\r\nauthorization measure, but this will be refunded after each ride.</i><br>\r\nIf your credit card or bank account is showing an unknown charge, please get in touch with\r\nyour bank and initiate a support request with us. We will then look into your claim and\r\nadjust the charge accordingly.'),
(6381,	239,	'_block_2_questions_4_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6382,	239,	'block_2_questions',	'5'),
(6383,	239,	'_block_2_questions',	'field_5caf3b2cbbe3f'),
(6384,	239,	'block_3_h2',	'Safety'),
(6385,	239,	'_block_3_h2',	'field_5caf3b5bbbe42'),
(6386,	239,	'block_3_questions_0_question',	'Checking your vehicle for safety'),
(6387,	239,	'_block_3_questions_0_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6388,	239,	'block_3_questions_0_answer',	'Before unlocking your e-scooter, check it over for damage. If there are wires coming out or\r\nother obvious damage, let us know through the app and find a different vehicle to use.'),
(6389,	239,	'_block_3_questions_0_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6390,	239,	'block_3_questions_1_question',	'Is there an age limit?'),
(6391,	239,	'_block_3_questions_1_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6392,	239,	'block_3_questions_1_answer',	'Every region, country and city will have different age restrictions, but we advise that only\r\n\r\npeople 21 years or older drive the vehicles.'),
(6393,	239,	'_block_3_questions_1_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6394,	239,	'block_3_questions_2_question',	'Is a driver’s license necessary?'),
(6395,	239,	'_block_3_questions_2_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6396,	239,	'block_3_questions_2_answer',	'No, a driver’s license is not legally required for e-scooter operation.'),
(6397,	239,	'_block_3_questions_2_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6398,	239,	'block_3_questions_3_question',	'Is a helmet necessary?'),
(6399,	239,	'_block_3_questions_3_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6400,	239,	'block_3_questions_3_answer',	'For your safety, you should always wear a helmet while riding our scooters.'),
(6401,	239,	'_block_3_questions_3_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6402,	239,	'block_3_questions_4_question',	'Helmet Laws'),
(6403,	239,	'_block_3_questions_4_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6404,	239,	'block_3_questions_4_answer',	'Every region, country, and city has its own laws about helmets. Using safety equipment\r\nlike helmets does not completely protect you from injury, but we suggest you always wear\r\nthem in order to minimize risk. Some regions legally require riders to wear helmets, so\r\ncheck local regulations and use safety gear accordingly. If you are injured while riding\r\nwithout a helmet, we do not bear responsibility for your choice to take this risk.'),
(6405,	239,	'_block_3_questions_4_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6406,	239,	'block_3_questions_5_question',	'Safe driving'),
(6407,	239,	'_block_3_questions_5_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6408,	239,	'block_3_questions_5_answer',	'Driving as carefully and safely as possible should be your top priority while on one of our\r\nscooters, meaning you should obey all traffic laws and use your best judgment when riding.'),
(6409,	239,	'_block_3_questions_5_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6410,	239,	'block_3_questions_6_question',	'What if I have an accident?'),
(6411,	239,	'_block_3_questions_6_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6412,	239,	'block_3_questions_6_answer',	'If there is an accident and need medical help, contact your local emergency services for\r\n\r\nassistance.\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>If you are injured, please stay at the location where the accident took place.</li>\r\n<li> If you are not injured, find a safe area nearby to move to.</li>\r\n</ul>'),
(6413,	239,	'_block_3_questions_6_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6414,	239,	'block_3_questions',	'7'),
(6415,	239,	'_block_3_questions',	'field_5caf3b2cbbe3f'),
(6416,	239,	'block_4_h2',	'Technical Issues'),
(6417,	239,	'_block_4_h2',	'field_5caf3b5bbbe42'),
(6418,	239,	'block_4_questions_0_question',	'I’m still being charged even after\r\nlocking the vehicle.'),
(6419,	239,	'_block_4_questions_0_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6420,	239,	'block_4_questions_0_answer',	'If your vehicle is charging you after being locked:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Double-check the lock on the vehicle and ensure that it’s closed—you should hear a\r\n\r\nconfirmation sound when it’s properly locked.</li>\r\n<li>The ride may take up to one minute to finish processing even after the vehicle is locked.</li>\r\n<li>Does your phone have a strong data or Wi-Fi signal? If not, this may cause issues.</li>\r\n<li>Close and restart the app, then check if the issue persists.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nIf you’ve tried all of the above steps and the issue is ongoing, contact our customer service\r\ndepartment. We will investigate and refund the charges.'),
(6421,	239,	'_block_4_questions_0_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6422,	239,	'block_4_questions_1_question',	'I can’t see the map'),
(6423,	239,	'_block_4_questions_1_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6424,	239,	'block_4_questions_1_answer',	'Make sure that GPS is enabled in your phone’s settings.'),
(6425,	239,	'_block_4_questions_1_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6426,	239,	'block_4_questions_2_question',	'Emergency'),
(6427,	239,	'_block_4_questions_2_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6428,	239,	'block_4_questions_2_answer',	'Contact your local emergency services number if you need medical or police assistance.'),
(6429,	239,	'_block_4_questions_2_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6430,	239,	'block_4_questions_3_question',	'My vehicle broke down'),
(6431,	239,	'_block_4_questions_3_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6432,	239,	'block_4_questions_3_answer',	'Stop riding the vehicle right away if it begins experiencing any problems that might cause\r\nyou injury or stop you from making it to your destination. Please report this issue to our\r\ncustomer support team and leave the vehicle where it is. This ride will be free of charge.'),
(6433,	239,	'_block_4_questions_3_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6434,	239,	'block_4_questions_4_question',	'The vehicle displayed on the map is\r\nmissing'),
(6435,	239,	'_block_4_questions_4_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6436,	239,	'block_4_questions_4_answer',	'Poor phone reception can cause issues when trying to find a vehicle. If you can’t find the\r\nvehicle, make sure you have good reception and that you’ve checked all possible parking\r\nspots in the area—it might be behind a vehicle or a building. If the vehicle is impossible to\r\nlocate, please notify us through the app’s “Report Missing” feature and select a different\r\nnearby vehicle.'),
(6437,	239,	'_block_4_questions_4_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6438,	239,	'block_4_questions_5_question',	'I’m having trouble unlocking an e-\r\nscooter'),
(6439,	239,	'_block_4_questions_5_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6440,	239,	'block_4_questions_5_answer',	'First, please check if your network is well connected. If the E-Scooter does not\r\nunlock on the first try, please close the app, restart and try again.\r\nYou should be able to unlock any vehicle by scanning its QR code or entering its\r\nplate number. If there isn’t enough light to read the QR code you can always enter\r\nthe number or press the flashlight button to light up the code for your camera.'),
(6441,	239,	'_block_4_questions_5_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6442,	239,	'block_4_questions',	'6'),
(6443,	239,	'_block_4_questions',	'field_5caf3b2cbbe3f'),
(6444,	239,	'block_5_h2',	'Reporting Problems'),
(6445,	239,	'_block_5_h2',	'field_5caf3b5bbbe42'),
(6446,	239,	'block_5_questions_0_question',	'Reporting damaged vehicles and malfunctions'),
(6447,	239,	'_block_5_questions_0_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6448,	239,	'block_5_questions_0_answer',	'Please report any damaged vehicles you come across via the app or through <a href=\"/support\">this form</a> which goes to customer support. Do not use a damaged vehicle; find another one instead.'),
(6449,	239,	'_block_5_questions_0_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6450,	239,	'block_5_questions_1_question',	'Reporting illegal parking'),
(6451,	239,	'_block_5_questions_1_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6452,	239,	'block_5_questions_1_answer',	'If you find an illegally parked vehicle we would appreciate your help by reporting it in our\r\napp or through <a href=\"/support\">this form</a>, including the plate number and QR code of the reported vehicle.'),
(6453,	239,	'_block_5_questions_1_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6454,	239,	'block_5_questions_2_question',	'Billing issues'),
(6455,	239,	'_block_5_questions_2_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6456,	239,	'block_5_questions_2_answer',	'If you believe there’s a problem with how you’ve been billed, just fill out <a href=\"/support\">this form</a> and our\r\ncustomer support team will get back to you. We will look into the issue and fix any\r\nproblematic charges.'),
(6457,	239,	'_block_5_questions_2_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6458,	239,	'block_5_questions',	'3'),
(6459,	239,	'_block_5_questions',	'field_5caf3b2cbbe3f'),
(6460,	239,	'block_6_h2',	'About Us'),
(6461,	239,	'_block_6_h2',	'field_5caf3b5bbbe42'),
(6462,	239,	'block_6_questions_0_question',	'BRiZ Company'),
(6463,	239,	'_block_6_questions_0_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6464,	239,	'block_6_questions_0_answer',	'BRiZ is a mobility company. Our goal is to sustainably reshape current mobility\r\nsolutions by offering new means of transportation. We want to incentivize the\r\nusage of e-scooters for the last mile commuting, reducing CO2 emission,\r\ndiscovering the city or just having a fun time. We are committed to providing you\r\nwith an easy, healthy, convenient, reliable, and environmentally friendly way to\r\ntravel by combining an advanced idea with self-developed IoT (Internet of Things)\r\ntechnology.'),
(6465,	239,	'_block_6_questions_0_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6466,	239,	'block_6_questions_1_question',	'BRiZ App'),
(6467,	239,	'_block_6_questions_1_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6468,	239,	'block_6_questions_1_answer',	'BRiZ App is a smart dock-less mobility platform. We offer app-based micro-mobility\r\nsolutions, like dockless scooters that you can use whenever you need to take a quick trip.\r\nJust open the app, locate a scooter, scan the QR code, and start riding!\r\nWe mostly focus on dockless scooters to help people move that last mile between public\r\ntransit and home, or just over short distances where transit is impractical and walking too\r\nslow. Sharing e-scooters means you can use the vehicles without needing to worry about\r\nmaintenance or theft, cities can save money on running transportation systems, and the\r\nurban environment will have a smaller carbon footprint and a healthier population.\r\nOur goal is to improve the cities we live in by promoting a simple, sustainable mode of\r\ntransportation and building up a responsible, cooperative community of users.'),
(6469,	239,	'_block_6_questions_1_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6470,	239,	'block_6_questions_2_question',	'BRiZ Support'),
(6471,	239,	'_block_6_questions_2_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6472,	239,	'block_6_questions_2_answer',	'Our customer service support is accessible on a 24/7 basis. Anyone can email us at <a href=\"mailto:hello@briz.app\">hello@briz.app</a>\r\nOur field operations teams run 24 hours per day'),
(6473,	239,	'_block_6_questions_2_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6474,	239,	'block_6_questions_3_question',	'What is this?'),
(6475,	239,	'_block_6_questions_3_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6476,	239,	'block_6_questions_3_answer',	'Our smart dockless micro-mobility program runs on dock-free electric scooters (“e-\r\nscooters”) that people can temporarily rent for short trips in towns and cities. We’re using\r\nthe Internet of Things to provide a convenient, simple, healthy, steady, and green means of\r\ntransportation. Users don’t need to carry keys, pay in cash, show ID cards, or make\r\n\r\ndeposits: they can just scan their ride on their app and ride off in seconds.'),
(6477,	239,	'_block_6_questions_3_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6478,	239,	'block_6_questions_4_question',	'Why use our e-scooters?'),
(6479,	239,	'_block_6_questions_4_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6480,	239,	'block_6_questions_4_answer',	'We are primarily focused on creating innovative mobility solutions, with our main goal\r\nbeing to introduce new means of transportation to people and cities that need them. Our e-\r\nscooters are a great way to go that last mile between public transit and end destinations, or\r\nthey could be used simply for exploring. Our scooters can be found all around the cities we\r\nhave a presence in and can be comfortably driven between any two points in our operating\r\narea. We have a variety of price plans to suit every customer’s needs, and our dedicated\r\ncustomer support team is always ready to deal with any questions or concerns.'),
(6481,	239,	'_block_6_questions_4_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6482,	239,	'block_6_questions_5_question',	'Become a charger'),
(6483,	239,	'_block_6_questions_5_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6484,	239,	'block_6_questions_5_answer',	'You’re interested in becoming a BRiZ charger and charging our fleet? Put yourself on the\r\nwaiting list by filling out <a href=\"/become-a-charger/\">this form</a> or register in the BRiZ App and we’ll get back\r\nto you.'),
(6485,	239,	'_block_6_questions_5_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6486,	239,	'block_6_questions_6_question',	'Become a partner'),
(6487,	239,	'_block_6_questions_6_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6488,	239,	'block_6_questions_6_answer',	'<a href=\"mailto:partners@briz.app\">partners@briz.app</a>'),
(6489,	239,	'_block_6_questions_6_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6490,	239,	'block_6_questions_7_question',	'Press'),
(6491,	239,	'_block_6_questions_7_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6492,	239,	'block_6_questions_7_answer',	'<a href=\"mailto:press@briz.app\">press@briz.app</a>'),
(6493,	239,	'_block_6_questions_7_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6494,	239,	'block_6_questions',	'9'),
(6495,	239,	'_block_6_questions',	'field_5caf3b2cbbe3f'),
(6496,	239,	'block_1_questions_11_question',	'Basic Rules for riding an e-\r\nscooter'),
(6497,	239,	'_block_1_questions_11_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6498,	239,	'block_1_questions_11_answer',	'- Riding on the sidewalk: not allowed.<br>\r\n- Streets without differentiated sidewalk: Only allowed when the use of vehicles is\r\nauthorized and always at a speed of 10 or 20 km/h<br>\r\n- Bike lane placed on the sidewalk: - Riding will be allowed as long as it is done in the\r\ndirection indicated on the lane, at a speed of 10 or 20 km/h and following the traffic\r\nsignals.<br>\r\n- 30 km/h zone: - Riding will be allowed when the vehicles’ speed is higher than 20 km/h.<br>\r\n- Road: - Only if the street or the regional road network is equipped with cycling\r\n\r\ninfrastructure (bike lane).<br>\r\n- Parks: - Riding will only be allowed at a speed limit of 10 km/h. Pedestrians’ priority,\r\nnatural heritage, and urban furniture shall be respected.<br>\r\n- Traffic signals, bike lanes and routes shall be followed, if available.<br>\r\n- Riding on parterres, areas with any kind of vegetation, or any area that indicates a\r\nprohibition is not allowed.'),
(6499,	239,	'_block_1_questions_11_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6500,	239,	'block_6_questions_8_question',	'Suggestions and feedback'),
(6501,	239,	'_block_6_questions_8_question',	'field_5caf3b3ebbe40'),
(6502,	239,	'block_6_questions_8_answer',	'We want to do everything we can to help you have a great experience, so we’re always\r\nhappy to hear your feedback! If you have anything you’d like to let us know, please <a href=\"/support\">contact\r\ncustomer support</a>.<br>\r\nThanks for riding!'),
(6503,	239,	'_block_6_questions_8_answer',	'field_5caf3b46bbe41'),
(6504,	241,	'list_0_title',	'Meet BRiZ'),
(6505,	241,	'_list_0_title',	'field_5ccc6ecb7ffc7'),
(6506,	241,	'list_0_text',	'BRiZ e-scooter makes a short commute across densely populated urban areas really easy, eco-friendly and extremely enjoyable. Did we mention its also very affordable? The scooters only cost $1 to start and then 25 cents per minute. Are you ready to take a ride?'),
(6507,	241,	'_list_0_text',	'field_5ccc6ed97ffc8'),
(6508,	241,	'list_0_image',	'147'),
(6509,	241,	'_list_0_image',	'field_5ccc6edf7ffc9'),
